# Links that lychee must skip. One regular expression per line.
#
# Placeholder booking URL in the home page "Book a demo" block (#102). The
# page does not exist yet, so it returns 404. Remove this line when the real
# booking page replaces it. Switch-on checklist item in PR #106: "Replace the
# placeholder booking URL https://cal.com/apexyard/demo with the real
# booking page".
^https://cal\.com/apexyard/demo(\?.*)?$

# Clean URLs of the three product pages (#102). The CDN serves /build,
# /gate and /readiness from build.html, gate.html and readiness.html, so
# the offline file check cannot resolve them. The CI workflow excludes the
# older clean URLs the same way.
^file://.*/(build|gate|readiness)$
^file://.*/pricing#(build|gate|readiness)$
# Their canonical production URLs return 404 until the pages reach
# production. Remove this line after the switch-on deploy.
^https://apexyard\.ai/(build|gate|readiness)$
